   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "By what means, specifically?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "Launch sporadic attacks on the military bases@on Earth's moon and on the space colonies.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "That will make them think@our targets are scattered.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "And the real aim is to leave that sector@as lightly defended as possible?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "Correct.@For this operation, the <Golaikunru>@will be taking action as well.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "Iradoya",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "Yes, yes, I've heard all about it from Lord@Gomoudokka. I'll throw in machines@and Bioroids generously, too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "...And the mission assigned to me? Word has it@that Sieg and Sally boarded a battleship@cooperating with the Steel Dragons.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "Carry it out if you encounter that battleship@as part of the diversion. If the <Ariard>@is aboard, retake it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "Sir!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "The time is near. Clear your name before then...@if you care about Malum's safety.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "(...That's all? Why is Lord Herluga@so lenient toward Vort?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "(He's certainly an excellent pilot,@but he's an <Anex>.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "Reggiane",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "Bilgo, you'd better get results too.@If you can't, I'll punish you personally.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "Y-yes, sir...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "(Punished personally by Lady Reggiane...@That would actually be...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "Furthermore, as for the factions hostile to@Earthlings... attack them if you judge them to be@obstacles to us. That is all.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "Now, now, here's some juicy news for dear Vort.@That battleship helping the Steel Dragons,@the Kurogane... seems it just came up into space~",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "I've told you many times before,@but we want the Ariard's@Siebe Drive too~",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "I've got a feeling it's on the Kurogane,@so could you go check for real~?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "Understood. I'll go.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "I'm launching too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "(I can't trust this man...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "Well then, I'm counting on you~",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "Near Earth",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "Kurogane - Hangar",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "Minaki",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "So the Super Soul Saber isn't putting out@the power we originally planned, after all.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "Jinpu",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "The Soul Saber itself is one thing,@but we rushed to finish the Saber Booster...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "Eric",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "Maybe we should try fitting it@with a TE Engine or something.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "Clifford",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "I think that would just make@the adjustments harder.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "There's space for it. We'll manage somehow.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "But in the meantime, the Super Soul Saber@won't be able to sortie.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "Well, that's true.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "(Mind you, what I'm really after is something else.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "Fairy",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "...About the output problem: couldn't we set@some rules for using the energy weapons?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Didn't expect a suggestion like that@from you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "But Akimi kind of picks his weapons@by feel... I guess it can't be helped@with the FF equipment, though.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "Why not try switching who's piloting?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "I'm not very good at close combat...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "Knowing Akimi, he'd probably dive into@the enemy's guard even with the GG equipment.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "So... I looked through his combat data@and made some simple rules.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "Ooh, now this is...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "It takes Akimi's habits into account...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "And you haven't been aboard@the Super Soul Saber long, either.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "You must be good at analysis.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "I used to do that kind of work...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "So where'd Akimi himself run off to?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "If you mean him...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "Kurogane - Interior",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "...I brought some warm drinks. Here you go.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "Thank you. Um...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "I'm Despinis Graden.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "I'm Sally Emil. Nice to meet you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "Yes, nice to meet you too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "Still, it's nice being able to take a break like this.@Thanks for showing me around, Akimi.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "Ah, well, sure.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "Honestly, even though Gadisword people look like@Earthlings, I thought people would look at us@with prejudice.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "This world has all sorts of strangers.@Not as many as the <Endless Frontier>,@but it's a pretty lively world.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "Aliens are common knowledge here, after all...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "There are kaiju and stuff too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "And beings who aren't human, like me.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "What?! You look completely human, though...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "So am I.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "Actually, strictly speaking, I'm also...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "Aschen",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "I'm sure I don't look it at all,@but so am I.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "OK, pretty pony.@So what was it like on the planet Gadisword?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "Compared to Earth, our planet...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "An enemy attack!?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "Operator",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "Approaching unknowns identified!@Zovorg and Gadisword mobile weapons!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "Captain, I'm launching.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "Yes, sir. Good luck out there.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "This reading... It's that new Gadisword@model we fought the other day!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "Then the captain's here...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "(Vort...!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "The Haga and the Varga... Sieg and Sally, then.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "So they've sided with the Earthlings.@Shameless...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "(And that machine is the one from last time...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "Vort, can you hear me?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "Fairy...! Why are you there?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "To learn the truth Herluga hid,@and to expose his schemes!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "Is that why you sided with the Earthlings?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "Herluga's way will only spread the conflict!@It could destroy the Gadisword people@of <Rabulpaila>!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "For drifters like us, should we choose the islet@before us, or the bountiful continent...?@The answer is obvious.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "The <Golaikunru> are war merchants!@They just want Rabulpaila's technology!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "I can't believe they care about the future@of us Gadisword people!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "What nonsense is this traitor spouting?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "Hmph, Bilgo, is it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "You... Not only did you desert, you've sided@with the Earthlings and turned your blades on us.@That crime is unforgivable.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "Look who's talking!@You hid the truth from us and teamed up with@the Golaikunru. What are you planning?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "The restoration of Gadisword, obviously.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "And the key to that is the Siebe Drive?@Herluga's methods stink to high heaven.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "That man cares about Gadisword's future@more than anyone.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "And yet Fairy stole the Ariard and disrupted his@plans. She's the root of the calamity@befalling Gadisword!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "Hold on a second!@Fairy wanted to prevent a war@between Earth and Gadisword!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "You're the ones who asked Earth for help@and then invaded!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "...Fairy, Sieg, Sally.@This is your last chance. If you come back,@I'll intercede with Herluga for you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "Vort, what are you saying?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "Captain... Sorry, but I can't trust Herluga.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "Neither... do I intend to go back.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "Fairy... What about you?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "...There's no reason for Gadisword and Earth to@fight. The facts Herluga is hiding... If you know@even a fragment of them, tell me.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "I have a reason to fight here.@You're the one who should return to your people.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "Vort, enough talk.@Have you forgotten Lord Herluga's orders?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 361,
   "en": "...If you still refuse to surrender, so be it.@Don't think you can stop this Gyanonia Ogre.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 362,
   "en": "(Surrender?@Hmph... So that's how it is, after all.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 363,
   "en": "Rätsel, the enemy will be after@the <Ariard> inside the ship.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 364,
   "en": "Dyna 2 to all units!@Don't let the enemy near the Kurogane!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 365,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 366,
   "en": "...Just as Gilliam intended,@we've drawn Gadisword in too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 367,
   "en": "In a way, we're bait that stands out@for all the wrong reasons.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 368,
   "en": "But isn't it possible that Vort@doesn't actually mean to fight Fairy?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 369,
   "en": "You're right, those two...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 370,
   "en": "(...I'm hardly one to talk.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 371,
   "en": "So you're after the fairy, not just the treasure?@True, the fairy on this side does look gentle.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 372,
   "en": "Akemi, we're holding Vort off!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 373,
   "en": "Right!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 374,
   "en": "I'm sorry...@for dragging you into this.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 375,
   "en": "That's old news by now.@I'm the one who suggested you ride@in the Saber Booster, anyway.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 376,
   "en": "Besides, I want to stop any war I can, too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 377,
   "en": "Thank you, both of you...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 378,
   "en": "Akemi, let's hold Vort off@with the Super Soul Saber!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 379,
   "en": "(Unless I take back the Ariard,@I can't persuade Herluga...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 380,
   "en": "(Fairy... There's no more time.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 381,
   "en": "An enemy unit has latched onto the ship!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 382,
   "en": "Don't let them get inside!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 383,
   "en": "It's no use, we won't make it in time!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 384,
   "en": "Nngh! I-If I die in a place like this,@Lady Reggiane will...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 385,
   "en": "I must return alive@and receive her scolding!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 386,
   "en": "Blast it, no more! I'm withdrawing!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 387,
   "en": "...To struggle this much even without@the Steel Dragons' main force...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 388,
   "en": "All remaining units, withdraw at once.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 389,
   "en": "...You'll answer for this, Vort.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 390,
   "en": "Of course. Go on ahead.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 391,
   "en": "Is he trying to run?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 392,
   "en": "Captain Vort!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 393,
   "en": "What's Herluga hiding?!@What's that bastard plotting with the Golaikunru?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 394,
   "en": "...I have no need to answer that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 395,
   "en": "So it must be something big!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 396,
   "en": "Vort! What on earth happened?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 397,
   "en": "In that case, I'll get it straight from him!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 398,
   "en": "In that case, I'll ask him myself!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 399,
   "en": "I won't let you!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 400,
   "en": "Ah, aaah!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 401,
   "en": "Akimi!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 402,
   "en": "Ugh, ngh... I-I thought we had him cornered...@What power...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 403,
   "en": "Akemi!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 404,
   "en": "Ugh, ngh... I-I thought we had him cornered...@What power...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 405,
   "en": "Fairy, at least you...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 406,
   "en": "Ngh!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 407,
   "en": "While Vort's faltering,@get the Super Soul Saber!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 408,
   "en": "...I can't push any further, it seems.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 409,
   "en": "Enemy commander unit withdrawing!@All enemy readings in the combat zone are gone!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 410,
   "en": "Are you okay, Akimi, Akemi?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 411,
   "en": "S-Somehow...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 412,
   "en": "H-Has he... not been fighting@seriously until now...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 413,
   "en": "(Vort...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 414,
   "en": "(With the Super Soul Saber's current power,@we're no match for him...?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 415,
   "en": "Are you okay, Akemi, Akimi?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 416,
   "en": "H-Has he... not been fighting@seriously until now...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 417,
   "en": "(With the Super Soul Saber's current power,@we're no match for his machine...?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 418,
   "en": "In the end, we never found out@anything important...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 419,
   "en": "No, we found out one thing.@And it's a big one.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 420,
   "en": "Huh? What?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 421,
   "en": "The... relationship between a certain two people.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 422,
   "en": "(Fairy...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 423,
   "en": "(I was curious about that too...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 424,
   "en": "OK, cool fairy. I'll ask you straight.@Isn't Vort your steady?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 425,
   "en": "...That's in the past.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 426,
   "en": "(So there was one more thing drawing them in.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 427,
   "en": "Hmm... You could say that's what saved@the Super Soul Saber this time.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 428,
   "en": "Urk...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 429,
   "en": "The other day, Vort made a surprise attack on the@Hagane and yet demanded that Fairy and the others@be handed over. That didn't sit right with me...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 430,
   "en": "Perhaps he wanted to get you back unharmed.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 431,
   "en": "But I...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 432,
   "en": "Yes, I know.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 433,
   "en": "(So it's the man who still has feelings, huh...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
